全新內容。","nat.boardStarHermit":"StarHermit — 最長的集會","nat.loading":"載入中…","nat.boardUnavailable":"目前無法讀取 StarHermit 板。","nat.lobbyOffline":"以訪客身分玩 — 分享畫面 2P 可在任何地方使用。","Force the corners, own the center.":"強行佔領角落，佔領中心。","Lesson 1 — Move":"第 1 課 — 移動","Slide your paddle left and right.":"左右滑動槳。","Move your paddle toward the left wall. Drag, use ← →, or tap the left side.":"將槳移向左牆。拖曳、使用 ← → 或點選左側。","Your paddle is the bright bar on your goal line.":"您的球拍是球門線上的亮條。","Now move it toward the right wall.":"現在將其移向右側牆壁。","The paddle follows your pointer or arrow keys.":"槳跟隨您的指針或箭頭鍵。","Lesson 2 — Serve":"第 2 課 — 發球","Put the ball in play.":"將球投入比賽。","The ball is yours. Press Space, tap the ball, or use the Serve button.":"球是你的。按空白鍵、點擊球或使用發球按鈕。","Serving sends the ball toward the far goal line.":"發球將球送向遠球門線。","Lesson 3 — Return":"第 3 課 — 返回","Meet the ball with your paddle.":"用球拍擊球。","Return the ball once. Get your paddle under it before it crosses your line.":"將球回傳一次。在它越過你的線之前將你的槳放在它下面。","Watch the trail — meet the ball, don’t chase it.":"觀察軌跡－迎接球，不要追它。","Lesson 4 — Angle":"第 4 課 — 角度","Strike off-center to bend your return.":"偏離中心擊球以彎曲你的回球。","Hit the ball with the outer half of your paddle to send it wide.":"用球拍外側的一半擊球，將球打向側邊。","Edge hits bend the return; center hits go straight.":"邊緣命中彎曲返回；中心擊球直接進行。","Lesson 5 — Score & Win":"第 5 課 — 得分與勝利","Score through the far goal line to win.":"透過遠球門線得分即可獲勝。","Score one point — send the ball past the far paddle, over the far line.":"得一分－將球送過遠處的球拍，越過遠處的線。","Angled returns are harder to catch.":"斜角回球更難接。","Finish it — win the match.":"完成它－贏得比賽。","First point wins this one.":"第一點獲勝。","First Contact":"首次接觸","Learn the arena. First to 3, slow ball.":"了解競技場。第一個到第三個，慢球。","Ignition":"點火","Return Form":"退貨表格","Hold your ground and return cleanly.":"堅守陣地並乾淨俐落地返回。","Wide Guard":"寬防護","A wider arena demands anticipation.":"更寬的競技場需要預判。","Edge Work":"邊緣工作","Use the paddle edge to bend returns.":"使用槳邊緣來彎曲迴線。","Tempo":"節奏","The ball gains pace with every hit.":"球隨著每次擊球而加快速度。","Pressure Line":"壓力管線","Opponent tracks faster. Stay calm.":"對手追蹤得更快。保持冷靜。","Ignition Trial":"點火試驗","Prove the basics under margin rules.":"證明保證金規則下的基礎知識。","Mastery: Ignition":"精通：點火","Mastery stage — win by 3 against Glide.":"精通階段 — 以 3 勝 Glide 獲勝。","Angles":"角度","Slice":"切片","Sharper returns, sharper angles.":"更銳利的返回、更銳利的角度。","Narrow Margin":"毫釐之差","A slimmer paddle, a slimmer path.":"更細的槳，更細的路徑。","Long Court":"朗閣","A longer court rewards deep angles.":"一個更長的球場獎勵深角度。","Quickstep":"快步","Faster exchanges. Read the rebound.":"更快的交換。閱讀反彈。","Corner Trap":"角落陷阱","Angles Gate":"角度之門","Win with pace against Flow.":"以速度擊敗 Flow。","First Bumper":"第一保險槓","A single deflector changes the map.":"單一偏轉器改變地圖。","Bumpers":"彈簧墊","Mastery: Angles":"精通：角度","Mastery stage — angled returns, no cheap points.":"精通階段——斜線回球，沒有輕鬆得分。","Twin Deflectors":"雙導流板","Two bumpers guard the middle.":"兩個保險桿保護中間。","Offset Lanes":"偏移車道","Asymmetric deflectors. Re-read every rebound.":"非對稱偏轉器。重新閱讀每次反彈。","Pinball":"彈珠","Four deflectors. Chaos is a pattern.":"四个偏转器。混沌是一種模式。","Bumper Trial":"緩衝器試煉","Hold the line amid deflections.":"在偏轉中堅守陣線。","Crosswind":"側風","A moving blocker sweeps mid-court.":"一個移動的障礙物在中場掃過。","Double Sweep":"雙重橫掃","Two blockers, alternating pressure.":"兩個阻斷劑，交替壓力。","Crossfire":"交叉火力","Crossfire Gate":"交叉火力門","Survive the sweep against Surge.":"在對抗Surge的掃蕩中倖存下來。","Mastery: Crossfire":"精通：交叉火力","Mastery stage — blockers and margin pressure.":"精通階段——設有阻擋者及邊緣壓力。","Overdrive":"超頻","The pace climbs. So do you.":"步伐加快。你也一樣。","Razor":"剃刀","Slim paddle, full speed.":"細長槳，全速。","Deep Court":"深閣","The longest court at full pace.":"全速行駛的最長球場。","Reactor":"反應器","Deflectors at overdrive pace.":"偏轉器以超速行駛。","Blitz":"閃電戰","Short target, sudden pressure.":"短期目標，突如其來的壓力。","Ion Storm":"離子風暴","Blockers sweep a fast court.":"障礙清掃快速場地。","Overdrive Gate":"超速門","Hold pace against Pulse.":"保持與脈衝的同步。","Mastery: Overdrive":"精通：超速","Mastery stage — full speed, win by 3.":"精通階段 — 全速，以 3 勝。","Zenith Approach":"天頂法","The final chapter opens at pace.":"最終章快速展開。","Mirror Maze":"鏡子迷宮","Symmetric deflectors, asymmetric outcomes.":"對稱的偏轉器，不對稱的結果。","Swept Court":"橫掃法庭","Everything moves. Including you.":"一切都在移動。包括你。","Thin Ice":"薄冰","Slim paddle against the best tracker.":"針對最佳追蹤器的細長槳。","Mastery":"精通","Full Court Press":"全場緊迫盯人","A wide court, a fast ball, no excuses.":"寬敞的場地，快速的球，沒有藉口。","Chaos Theory":"混沌理論","Every mechanic, one arena.":"每個機械師，一個競技場。","The Long Rally":"長期反彈","A marathon to seven against Zenith.":"一場與Zenith的七局馬拉松。","Mastery: Zenith":"精通：天頂","Final mastery — everything combined, win by 3.":"最終掌握 — 一切綜合起來，以 3 獲勝。","Economy of Motion":"運動經濟性","Win 5–2 or better using at most 40 paddle commands. Every move counts.":"使用最多 40 個槳命令以 5-2 或更好的成績獲勝。每一步都很重要。","Overclocked":"超頻","The ball never drops below 22 units/s. Survive to 5.":"球的速度永遠不會低於22單位/秒。生存到5。","Pinball Alley":"彈珠巷","Six deflectors own the court. First to 6 in the chaos.":"六個偏轉器擁有球場。混亂中先到6。","Toothpick":"牙籤","Restricted tools: your paddle is a sliver. Win anyway.":"受限工具：你的槳是條子。無論如何都要贏。","Sudden Death":"猝死","One point decides it. Full pace. No margin for error.":"一分決定一切。全速前進。沒有容錯餘地。","The Gauntlet":"試煉場","Blockers, bumpers, a slim paddle, and a relentless opponent. Win by 3.":"障礙、緩衝器、狹窄的球拍和無情的對手。以 3 分獲勝。","Calm":"沉靜","Steady":"穩定","Brisk":"輕快","Fierce":"激烈","Zenith":"頂點","Standard":"標準","Quickfire":"速射","Deflector":"偏轉器","Sweep":"掃一掃","Slimline":"超薄型","Marathon":"馬拉松","First Light":"第一縷曙光","Win your first match.":"贏得你的第一場比賽。","Angle Master":"角度大師","Land 50 angled returns (outer-half paddle hits).":"Land 50 angled returns (outer-half paddle hits).","Five Alive":"五個活著","Win 5 matches in a row.":"連續贏得 5 場比賽。","Mastery Track":"精通軌道","Clear every Mastery stage in Journey.":"通過旅程中的每個精通關卡。","Centurion":"百夫長","Complete 100 matches, any mode.":"完成 100 場對戰，任何模式。","Daily Devotee":"每日虔誠者","Finish 7 daily challenges.":"完成 7 個每日挑戰。","Half the Horizon":"半邊地平線","Clear 20 Journey stages.":"通過 20 個旅程階段。","Full Circuit":"全電路","Clear all 40 Journey stages.":"通過全部 40 個旅程關卡。","Untouchable":"無法觸及","Win a match without conceding a single point.":"在不失一分的情況下贏得一場比賽。","Challenge Accepted":"接受挑戰","Clear all six Challenges.":"通過全部六個挑戰。"}
